    "scenesThatPass": [
      "ANNA: I'm sorry ... but I can't help laughing...\nGIULIA: It's as smooth and slick as oil.",
      "CLAUDIA: Did you sleep well?\nANNA: Yes, fairly well. But I went to bed last night planning to do some thinking about a number of things ... instead, I fell asleep.\nCLAUDIA: I didn't know one could sleep so well on a yacht. It lulls you ...\nANNA: It would be better for you to get some sun.",
      "CLAUDIA: Oh, no... please... not here. It looks too dangerous.\nGIULIA: At one time the Aeolian isles were all volcanoes.",
      "CLAUDIA: Stop ... stop the boat!\nGIULIA: How's the water?",
      "PATRIZIA: I have never understood the islands. With all that water around them, poor things ...\nANNA: When do you have to go back?"
    ]
  },
